# Repo-only files, excluded from the published pub package.
# `screenshots/` stays in the archive — pub.dev renders the images the
# pubspec's `screenshots:` section points at, so they must ship with the package.
# `shaders/` must stay in the archive too: `beam.frag` is declared under
# `flutter: shaders:` and compiled into every consuming app. Never ignore it.
assets/
tool/
CLAUDE.md
.demos/
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
# Golden reference images only matter to the repo's own CI, not to consumers.
test/golden/
